    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/6f1672a44c94ee173b28e96ac0c40088.avif?t=1754803178\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ryle received a strange letter from his father, after years of being away from home. In it, his father revealed that something had gone terribly wrong at the corporation where he worked. After a long journey, Ryle arrived deep within the Afgarn Mansion\u2026 and found that the security protocol had already been activated. The place was collapsing. He had only one option: find the key and get out before it was too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protocol was clear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<strong>DO NOT speak to any experiments.</strong>\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he moved forward, Ryle confirmed that several laboratories were still operational. The company had attempted to alter human DNA\u2026 and failed, fatally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experiments had survived. Mutated, hostile, and with unnatural abilities: phasing through walls, sensing movement\u2026 and something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They already knew he was there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And they were waiting for him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/9eb65d6c77e9c5a78c5433f4c24a9c00.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/9eb65d6c77e9c5a78c5433f4c24a9c00.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/9eb65d6c77e9c5a78c5433f4c24a9c00.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/c3f20fd4eab4b173b14453f55e37418a.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/c3f20fd4eab4b173b14453f55e37418a.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/c3f20fd4eab4b173b14453f55e37418a.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/0b7b4cec4d388cd8514d2781debe3042.avif?t=1754803178\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRIEF EXPLANATION OF THE GAME:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Haus of Irndrous, your stamina is limited\u2014push yourself too hard, and you'll be in danger. Your flashlight is your only hope in the darkness, but it won\u2019t always work. Each area contains puzzles that will test your observation and logic\u2026 all while you're being hunted by brutal enemies twisted by genetic experiments. They don't just want to catch you; they were designed to tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/31b7e1c68bb8f9844141ac5cfb858c06.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/31b7e1c68bb8f9844141ac5cfb858c06.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/31b7e1c68bb8f9844141ac5cfb858c06.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story in Haus of Irndrous isn't handed to you\u2014it\u2019s uncovered piece by piece. Hidden radios, scattered notes, and the mansion\u2019s eerie atmosphere slowly reveal the truth. Each audio log provides clues to solve puzzles or fragments of the dark past of the Afgarn Corporation and its inhuman experiments. Exploration and curiosity are rewarded, making you an active part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/d9fd01af82471b0f19a4df9b8d701918.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/d9fd01af82471b0f19a4df9b8d701918.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/d9fd01af82471b0f19a4df9b8d701918.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80s-Inspired Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a retro nightmare. Haus of Irndrous draws heavily from the 1980s, blending the mansion's decadent elegance with period technology\u2014vintage radios, VHS-style visual and sound effects. The result is a deeply immersive experience that evokes classic psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/725f0a455e16cbf56e83e5b83e442db4.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/725f0a455e16cbf56e83e5b83e442db4.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/725f0a455e16cbf56e83e5b83e442db4.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conquered area raises the stakes. Enemies become more aggressive, puzzles more complex, and environments more oppressive. The constant sense of danger makes every bit of progress feel like a true victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/5dc224b9ad20f9f3186c69af51025670.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/5dc224b9ad20f9f3186c69af51025670.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/5dc224b9ad20f9f3186c69af51025670.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the HUNTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/88637f22ee00f4da184e2a3d3ccce9a2.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/88637f22ee00f4da184e2a3d3ccce9a2.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/88637f22ee00f4da184e2a3d3ccce9a2.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
