tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/31b7e1c68bb8f9844141ac5cfb858c06.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/31b7e1c68bb8f9844141ac5cfb858c06.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story in Haus of Irndrous isn't handed to you\u2014it\u2019s uncovered piece by piece. Hidden radios, scattered notes, and the mansion\u2019s eerie atmosphere slowly reveal the truth. Each audio log provides clues to solve puzzles or fragments of the dark past of the Afgarn Corporation and its inhuman experiments. Exploration and curiosity are rewarded, making you an active part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.webm?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/dd75683c93db4e81b6f48b3223ba88eb.mp4?t=1754803178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914740/extras/d9fd01af82471b0f19a4df9b8d701918.poster.avif?t=1754803178\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as